# The base-image build-args of build/agentry-browser/Dockerfile, each mapped to
# its upstream ref. scripts/build.sh replaces each with our digest-pinned
# mirror and refuses to build if the ref is not in images.tsv.
#
# UBUNTU_IMAGE is the image's base: plain Ubuntu 24.04. Playwright supports
# it, and Chrome for Testing's libraries come from its archive. NODE_IMAGE is
# build-time only: it installs the server's packages from the lockfile, and
# its node binary (glibc, Node 24; Playwright needs 20 or later and noble's
# own is 18) is the only file the image takes from it.
UBUNTU_IMAGE=ubuntu:noble
NODE_IMAGE=node:24-bookworm-slim
